  "question": {
    "text": "If the distance between the foci of an ellipse is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math> and the distance between its directrix&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the length of its latus rectum is"
  },
